# MAIL_USERNAME / MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS → replace with your real Gmail
# address (the one you generated the App Password for).
# MAIL_PASSWORD → the 16-character App Password from
# https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords — NOT your normal Gmail
# login password. Remove all spaces when pasting it in.
